Package: cutefish-computer-use
Architecture: any
Depends: cutefish-compositor,
         ${misc:Depends},
         ${shlibs:Depends}
Description: Cutefish desktop control for agent apps
 An MCP server that lets agent apps see the Cutefish desktop and use its
 pointer and keyboard once the user allows it. The compositor asks the user
 for consent and can stop the agent at any time.
